<!DOCTYPE Bill PUBLIC "-//LSC//DTD Authoring Bill XML//EN" "l:\dtd\author\billauthoring.top"><Bill version="1.0" type="introLN" docName="H-4592.1"><IntroducedBillHeader><RequestNumber>H-4592.1</RequestNumber><BillNumber>HOUSE BILL 3155</BillNumber><StateLegSession><State>State of Washington</State><Legislature>58th Legislature</Legislature><Session>2004 Regular Session</Session></StateLegSession><Sponsors>Representative Morris</Sponsors><IntroHistory><ReadDate>Read first time 01/30/2004.  </ReadDate><ReferredTo>Referred to Committee on Technology, Telecommunications &amp; Energy.</ReferredTo></IntroHistory></IntroducedBillHeader><BriefDescription>Regarding energy efficiency.</BriefDescription><BillBody><PullFooter logNumber="H-4592.1/04" attorneyInitials="KB" typistInitials="rmh" dateCreated="01/28/2004"/><BillTitle><LineNumber line=" 1" page="1,1" hrt="no"/>	AN ACT Relating to energy efficiency; and creating a new section.</BillTitle><EnactingClause><LineNumber line=" 2" page="1,2" hrt="no"/>BE IT ENACTED BY THE LEGISLATURE OF THE STATE OF WASHINGTON:</EnactingClause><BillSection type="new"><LineNumber line=" 3" page="1,3" hrt="no"/><BegSecNew><NewSecText>NEW SECTION.</NewSecText><SecNum>Sec. </SecNum></BegSecNew><RCWSLText>The legislature intends to establish energy<LineNumber line=" 4" page="1,4"/>efficiency performance standards for state agencies and local<LineNumber line=" 5" page="1,5"/>governments and develop a program for capturing the energy savings to<LineNumber line=" 6" page="1,6"/>lower energy costs.</RCWSLText></BillSection><BillEnd>--- END ---<PageNumberFooter lastpage="yes">		p. 1	HB 3155</PageNumberFooter></BillEnd></BillBody></Bill>